SUBMIT AN EVENT

Add Your Event to the OCRA Calendar

The Obstacle Course Racing Association of Ireland (OCRA ÉIREANN) wants the OCRA Events Calendar to provide a useful overview of obstacle racing opportunities across Ireland.

If you organise an OCR event, obstacle challenge or suitable related competition in Ireland, you can submit it for inclusion.


Who Can Submit an Event?

Submissions are welcome from:

- Established OCR organisers
- New obstacle race organisers
- Clubs
- Training facilities
- Sporting organisations
- Other organisations delivering suitable obstacle racing events


Information We Need

Please provide:

- Event name
- Race organiser
- Event date
- Location
- Event website
- Registration URL
- Contact name
- Contact email
- Race distances or formats
- Adult and youth options
- Minimum age
- Competitive and/or recreational categories
- Short event description
- Event logo or promotional image, where available


OCRA Status

Please also tell us if you would like to discuss:

- OCRA sanctioning
- Qualification Event status
- Irish National Championship opportunities
- Technical Official support
- Other collaboration with OCRA

Submitting an event for the calendar does not automatically apply for or grant any of these statuses.


Event Listings

OCRA may review submissions before publication to make sure that they are relevant to the Irish obstacle racing community.

Listing an event on ocra.ie does not mean that OCRA operates, endorses or sanctions the event unless a specific OCRA status is displayed.


Changes to Your Event

If important event information changes after submission, please let us know.

This includes changes to:

- Date
- Venue
- Registration
- Cancellation
- Race formats
- Contact details

Keeping event information accurate helps athletes plan with confidence.


